      "message": "Merge origin/issue/570-probe-overtravel into issue/574-probe-m5\n\n#574 stacks on #570 (the probe cycle's opening rapid now ends at the safe\nplane and a protected feed descends to the approach plane).\n\n#570 branched before #174 (protected probe moves) reached main, so the\nmerge resolves:\n- the three Fanuc probe goldens #570 changed (probe_bore_centre,\n  probe_corner_negative, probe_edge_negative_x) and probe_corner.nc plus\n  tormach/probe_guard_moves.nc: the new descent posts as a guarded move\n  (G31 + #5063 alarm on Fanuc, G38.3 + #5070 test on Tormach), not G01;\n- probe_guard's counts: one more GUARD per mode (the opening descent),\n  five alarms / G38.3 blocks on the corner, the first descent now ends\n  at the approach plane (Z25).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL",
